OL,3,CMan sentenced to life again for 2018
OL,4,Cstone slab murder
OL,6,FA man who successfully appealed his
OL,7,Fconviction for murdering another man
OL,8,Fin Brighton has been jailed for life
OL,9,Fagain after a retrial.
OL,11,FSergio Lemori killed Andrew O'Connell,
OL,12,Fwhilst he slept in the city's Royal
OL,13,FPavilion Gardens, by repeatedly
OL,14,Fdropping a stone slab onto his head.
OL,16,FThe now 40-year-old was found guilty
OL,17,Fof murder and jailed for life in 2018.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
