OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786627118
OL,3,CMan sentenced to life again for 2018
OL,4,Cstone slab murder
OL,6,FBut, after serving six years of his
OL,7,Fsentence, Lemori successfully appealed
OL,8,Fhis conviction on the grounds of
OL,9,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,11,FThe case was brought back for a
OL,12,Fretrial at Hove Crown Court last
OL,13,Fmonth, where he was unanimously found
OL,14,Fguilty again of murder.
OL,16,FHe was re-sentenced to life
OL,17,Fimprisonment, with a minimum term of
OL,18,F25 years.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
