FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786627118
OL,3,CMan sentenced to life again for 2018
OL,4,Cstone slab murder
OL,6,FMr O'Connell, who was from Chatham, in
OL,7,FKent, was found with serious injuries
OL,8,Fon August 7, 2018 and died in hospital
OL,9,Ftwo days later.
OL,11,FThe 54-year-old, who was known to
OL,12,Fvoluntarily sleep out in the open on
OL,13,Foccasions, was described by his family
OL,14,Fas someone "whose life mattered beyond
OL,15,Fmeasure".
OL,17,FA statement read: "Although the
OL,18,Fdefendant chose to appeal, the truth
OL,19,Fremained unchanged.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
