FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786627118
OL,3,CMan sentenced to life again for 2018
OL,4,Cstone slab murder
OL,6,F"Justice has once again spoken, and
OL,7,Fthe guilty verdict stands.
OL,9,F"While no court decision can undo the
OL,10,Floss or erase the suffering, it
OL,11,Freaffirms what we have always known -
OL,12,Fthat Andy deserved justice, dignity,
OL,13,Fand to have his voice heard."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
